<title>GERMANY: Allianz plans building society venture.</title>
<headline>Allianz plans building society venture.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance giant Allianz AG Holding on Friday said it planned to set up a building society joint venture with Wuestenrot, a German mortgage bank.</p>
<p>Allianz said the joint venture would be centred around the mH Bausparkasse, a building society firm it acquired earlier this year as part of its takeover of Vereinte Versicherungs AG.</p>
<p>Allianz would give no further details on the planned joint venture with Wuestenrot, with which it has co-operated closely for several years.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
